# run here, minus the ones triaged away since. They are pre-existing debt made
# visible, not debt this lane created. Triaging them one by one -- wire up,
# delete, or waive with a real reason -- is the burn-down in ADR-0009 (BEO-67).
#
# Every line below carries the same marker, and that marker means "nobody has
# looked at this yet". It is not a justification and must not be reused on a
# new entry -- a new entry gets a real reason or it does not go in.
